### REFRESH_TOKEN
POST {{base_path}}{{port}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refresh_token}}"
}

### LOGOUT
POST {{base_path}}{{port}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}